        "text": "Why",
        "level": "h3"
      }
    },
    "why_text": {
      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "text": "The 1,500-star hyperstition still read \"12 stars needed from 1,488 (as of Oct 30); 7 days remaining\" when repo-pulse showed 1,489 stars and only 3 days remained (Nov 7 deadline). The ATH entry was updated by the LLM, but individual hyperstitions went stale. Downstream skills (token-report, heartbeat) propagated the stale context."
      }
