      "type": "Text",
      "props": {
        "text": "skills/memory-flush/SKILL.md: Added \"Active Targets data refresh\" sub-step to Step 4 rotation rules. Covers star/fork counts from repo-pulse, days remaining via bash arithmetic (avoiding LLM date math errors), and price/FDV from token-report. Inline replacements only."
      }
